{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/collections/decision-makers-guide-staff-guide","content_id":"5eba0447-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","description":"Guidance for DWP staff who make decisions about benefits, pensions and allowances.","details":{"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>This guidance is for <abbr title=\"Department for Work and Pensions\">DWP</abbr> staff who make decisions about benefits and pensions. It helps them make decisions that are accurate and consistent.</p>\n\n<p>The introduction of Universal Credit and Personal Independence Payment affects the guidance <abbr title=\"Department for Work and Pensions\">DWP</abbr> staff use.</p>\n\n<p><abbr title=\"Department for Work and Pensions\">DWP</abbr> decision makers now use <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/advice-for-decision-making-staff-guide\" class=\"govuk-link\">Advice for decision making</a> (instead of the <abbr title=\"Decision makers’ guide\">DMG</abbr>) for decisions that involve:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Universal Credit</li>\n  <li>Personal Independence Payment</li>\n  <li>contribution-based Jobseeker’s Allowance and contribution-based Employment and Support Allowance for <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/universal-credit/eligibility\" class=\"govuk-link\">people who are eligible for Universal Credit</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"why-we-publish-this-guide\">Why we publish this guide</h2>\n\n<p>We publish this guide to help people understand how we make decisions.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"information-for-claimants\">Information for claimants</h2>\n\n<p>Information for claimants about eligibility and how to claim:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/browse/benefits\" class=\"govuk-link\">benefits</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/browse/working/state-pension\" class=\"govuk-link\">pensions</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2013-10-28T09:50:00Z"}],"collection_groups":[{"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\">\n</div>","documents":["5e9d9e62-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","5e9d79a5-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef"],"title":"Documents"},{"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\">\n</div>","documents":["5eb58f10-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","5eb5bc1a-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","5eb5bea2-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","5eb98b0c-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","5eb9c53b-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","5eb9ce83-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","5eb9dd25-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","5eb9f4bd-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","5eb9f5b1-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef"],"title":"Volumes"}],"emphasised_organisations":["b548a09f-8b35-4104-89f4-f1a40bf3136d"],"first_public_at":"2013-10-28T09:50:00.000+00:00","headers":[{"id":"why-we-publish-this-guide","level":2,"text":"Why we publish this guide"},{"id":"information-for-claimants","level":2,"text":"Information for claimants"}],"political":false},"document_type":"document_collection","first_published_at":"2013-10-28T09:50:00+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/collections/decision-makers-guide-staff-guide","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/collections/decision-makers-guide-staff-guide","base_path":"/government/collections/decision-makers-guide-staff-guide","content_id":"5eba0447-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","document_type":"document_collection","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2013-10-28T09:50:00Z","schema_name":"document_collection","title":"Decision makers’ guide: staff guide","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/collections/decision-makers-guide-staff-guide","withdrawn":false}],"documents":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/decision-makers-guide-memos-staff-guide","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/decision-makers-guide-memos-staff-guide","base_path":"/government/publications/decision-makers-guide-memos-staff-guide","content_id":"5e9d9e62-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","document_type":"guidance","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at